{"speciesId":759,"names":{"fr":"Nounourson","es":"Stufful","en":"Stufful","ja":"ヌイコグマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il est à croquer, sauf lorsqu’il s’énerve et frappe à tout va. Dans ce cas, laissez-le tranquille ou vous finirez à coup sûr dans le décor."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Pese a su aspecto encantador, cuando se enoja, sus pataletas son tan feroces que pueden derribar hasta a un luchador profesional."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Despite its adorable appearance, when it gets angry and flails about, its arms and legs could knock a pro wrestler sprawling."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"愛くるしい 見た目だが 怒って ジタバタする 手足に ぶつかると プロレスラーでも 吹っ飛ばされる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ne tentez pas de le caresser s’il ne vous connaît pas assez : il entrerait dans une rage folle, et vous encourriez un grand danger."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cuando alguien con quien no haya congeniado lo toca, se pone hecho una furia y despliega una fuerza tal que lo hace tremendamente peligroso."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"A touch from anyone except a known friend sends it into a surging frenzy. It’s an incredibly dangerous Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"なついた 相手や 仲間以外に 触られると 物凄い 力で 暴れるので 非常に キケン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il est si fort qu’il peut abattre un grand arbre. L’odeur que dégage l’organe sur son derrière lui permet de communiquer avec ses semblables."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es capaz de derribar un árbol con su fuerza. Se comunica con sus congéneres mediante el olor que emite el órgano de su parte posterior."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It boasts power enough to split large trees in half. The organ on its rear releases an odor that it uses to communicate with others of its kind."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"大木も へし折る 力自慢。 おしりの 器官から 匂いを 出し 仲間と コミュニケーションをとる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il déteste être touché ou pris dans les bras, et se débat de toutes ses forces pour se dégager."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Odia que lo toquen o lo abracen. Se resiste empleando toda su fuerza, que es considerable."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Stufful hates to be hugged or touched in any way. It will squirm, thrash, and resist with amazing power."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"抱きしめられたり 触られるのが 大嫌い。 ジタバタ 暴れて 抵抗する 力は ものすごい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Sa fourrure duveteuse est très agréable à caresser, mais ceux qui la touchent sans prévenir s’exposent à une correction brutale."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su suave pelaje invita a acariciarlo, pero quien cometa semejante temeridad recibirá un severo escarmiento."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its fluffy fur is a delight to pet, but carelessly reaching out to touch this Pokémon could result in painful retaliation."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ふわふわの 毛並みは 触り心地が 抜群だが うかつに 手を だすと 手痛い 反撃を 受けてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa façon de remuer les pattes pour se défendre semble adorable, mais ce Pokémon est si puissant qu’il pourrait fendre un tronc de la sorte."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando patalea para tratar de defenderse resulta adorable, pero conviene no fiarse, ya que su fuerza sería capaz de derribar un árbol."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The way it protects itself by flailing its arms may be an adorable sight, but stay well away. This is flailing that can snap thick tree trunks."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"前脚を じたばた 振って 身を 守る 様子が 可愛らしいが 大木を へし折る 威力だ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":759,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0